# Times after a 3D page (the course, a car view) were scaled by 1.2 on 2026-10-22: those pages wait for vblank 120 times
# per second now that GT's vblank handler runs once per vblank (FINDINGS), not ~100.
# Route G — Driving Challenges: the block map, Block A, the list of challenges, A-1 "Stop 100 metres ahead!" (Audi A2, Test Course), Start,
# accelerate 7 s, brake 7 s (fails the challenge), the result screen and Retry (200 s). Page offsets: 1ce62e80 the block map, 1ce7d400 a block,
# 1cdf8540 the challenge list, 1cc98cc0 the challenge's start page, 1d19db00 the course's own pages.
3300:START,
WAIT:seek=0x1fa48900,1700:RIGHT,1900:RIGHT,2100:RIGHT,2500:CROSS,
WAIT:seek=0x1ce62e80,500:CROSS,
WAIT:seek=0x1ce7d400,500:CROSS,
WAIT:seek=0x1cdf8540,500:CROSS,
WAIT:seek=0x1cc98cc0,500:CROSS,
WAIT:seek=0x1d19db00,1080:CROSS:840,2400:SQUARE:1080,4200:CROSS:600
